Find [lists]
Finds the expression that you enter into the dialog Find and selects the cell in which the expression is
located.
Remarks
Plant Simulation searches the entire list/table if you do not click in a cell.
If you click in a cell, it starts searching at the selected cell toward the end of the list/table.
Proceed as follows:
• Type the expression you would like to find into the text box Find What.
• Select Match Case to only find text that has the same pattern of upper and lower case letters as the
expression you typed into the text box Find What.
• Select Match Entire Cell Contents to only find the characters in cells which exactly and completely
match the expression you typed into the text box Find What.
• Select if you want to Search in Rows, i.e., to the right across rows, or down through Columns.
Find [lists]
Plant Simulation Help 11-3841
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

• Select the Search criterion from the drop-down list:
Find: Finds the expression you typed into the text box Find What, compare find.
Find ceil(ing): Finds a value greater than or equal to the expression you typed into the text box Find
What, compare findCeil.
Find floor: Finds a value less than or equal to the expression you typed into the text box Find What,
compare findFloor.
• Click Find Next to find the next instance of the expression you typed into the text box Find What toward
the end of the list.
• Click Replace to show the text box Replace With. Type the expression into the text box Replace With
that is to replace the expression you typed into the text box Find What.
• Click Cancel to close the dialog.
SimTalk
find [SimTalk] - lists
findCeil [SimTalk]
findFloor [SimTalk]
Find [lists]
11-3842 Plant Simulation Help
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Replace [lists]
Finds an expression and replaces it with the expression that you type into the dialog Replace.
Remarks
Proceed as follows:
• Type the expression you would like to find into the text box Find What.
• Type the expression into the text box Replace With that is to replace the expression you typed into the
text box Find What.
• Select Match Case to only find text that has the same pattern of upper and lower case letters as the
expression you typed into the text box Find What.
• Select Match Entire Cell Contents to only find the characters in cells which exactly and completely
match the expression you typed into the text box Find What.
• Select if you want to Search in Rows, i.e., to the right across rows, or down through Columns.
• Select the Search Criterion from the drop-down list:
Find: Finds the expression you typed into the text box Find What, compare find.
Replace [lists]
Plant Simulation Help 11-3843
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Find ceil(ing): Finds a value greater than or equal to the expression you typed into the text box Find
What, compare findCeil.
Find floor: Finds a value less than or equal to the expression you typed into the text box Find What,
compare findFloor.
• Click Find Next to find the next instance of the expression you typed into the text box Find What.
• Click Replace to replace this instance of the search term or to show the text box Replace With.
• Click Replace All to replace all instances of the search term.
• Click Cancel to close the dialog.
