Go To Cell
Changes to the cell of the list or table, which you type into the dialog Go To.
Remarks
Proceed as follows:
• Type the number of the Column in which the active cell will be located.
• Type the number of the Row in which the active cell will be located.
This cell will then be the starting point for scrolling within the list or table. This makes moving within
large tables easy and comfortable.
• The box Occupied Columns shows the number of columns of the table that contain an entry.
• The box Occupied Rows shows the number of rows of the table that contain an entry.
