Sort Ascending [lists]
Sorts the lowest number (0 to 9), the earliest date, or the start of the alphabet (A to Z) first in the sorted
list.
Remarks
Sorting is case-sensitive.
Plant Simulation only sorts the selected column of the DataTable.
Note
Plant Simulation sorts empty cells at the end of the column for an ascending sort order.
For a descending sort order it sorts them at the start of the column.
