Sort Descending [lists]
Sorts the highest number (9 to 0), the latest date, or the end of the alphabet (Z to A) first in the sorted list.
Remarks
Sorting is case-sensitive.
Plant Simulation only sorts the column of the DataTable.
Note
Plant Simulation sorts empty cells at the end of the column for an ascending sort order.
For a descending sort order it sorts them at the start of the column.
