Inherit Format [button]
Turns inheritance of the format of the list off or on.
Remarks
When you insert a list into a Frame, it automatically inherits the format from its class. You can only change
the format of the new, instantiated list after you turn Inherit Format off. Turning this command off also
turns off Inherit Contents [lists].
SimTalk
InheritFormat [SimTalk]
See also
