Insert [context menu, lists]
To insert an empty row above the selected row into the selected list until it is full, select this command.
Remarks
The list is full if cells with content, which are moved down with the command Insert, has reached the end
of the specified Dimension of the DataList, the DataStack or the DataQueue.
In our example we set the Number of rows to 5. The first three rows contain an entry each. If we now
select Insert in row 3, we can do this twice until the end of the specified number of rows is reached. The
command Insert is now deactivated.
